-- חוזר לבעלויות תשע"ח/6: עדכון תוספת שקלית 2016 לעובדי הוראה
-- The 2016 shekel supplement of the kindergartens, primary and middle
-- divisions and teachers' colleges, linked to the consumer price index:
-- the monthly amounts from 1.1.2018 by the Ofek Hadash grade.

IMPORT prelude
IMPORT daydate
IMPORT common

§ `חוזר תשע"ח/6 עדכון תוספת שקלית 2016`

-- akn:preamble/p1 akn:preamble/p2 akn:preamble/p3 akn:preamble/p4 akn:preamble/p5 akn:preamble/p6 akn:preamble/p7 akn:preamble/p8 akn:preamble/p9 akn:preamble/p10 akn:preamble/p11 akn:preamble/p12 The letterhead, date, reference, addressee, greeting and subject line; no rule.

DECLARE `stage of education` IS ONE OF
    `kindergarten`
    `primary school`
    `middle division`
    `teachers' college`
    `upper division`

DECLARE `Ofek Hadash placement` IS ONE OF
    `academic grade 1`
    `academic grade 1.5`
    `academic grade 2`
    `academic grade 2.5`
    `any other placement, in Ofek Hadash or outside it`

@desc A teaching employee, as far as this circular asks.
DECLARE `teaching employee` HAS
    `rated in the teaching employees' grading` IS A BOOLEAN
    `employed by an owner of a ministry-supervised institution` IS A BOOLEAN
    `stage` IS A `stage of education`
    `placement` IS AN `Ofek Hadash placement` @desc the grade in the Ofek Hadash salary tables for academic teachers, if any

DECLARE `linkage action` IS ONE OF
    `indemnify the owner at the hour costs` HAS `indemnity` IS A NUMBER

-- akn:hc_1/p1 akn:hc_1/p2 akn:hc_1/p3 The sources of the linkage (the agreements of 30.9.2016 and 19.3.2017, circular 5777/3), the supplement's payment in steps, and the circular's purpose; the linked amounts are encoded below.

-- ¶16: December 2017's index against December 2015's.
@ref akn:hc_1/p4
GIVEN `index of December 2017` IS A NUMBER, `index of December 2015` IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `the linkage factor` `index of December 2017` `index of December 2015` IS
    `index of December 2017` DIVIDED BY `index of December 2015`

-- akn:hc_1/p5 The heading "תחולה"; no rule.

-- ¶18-¶19: kindergartens, primary schools, middle divisions and teachers'
-- colleges, in Ofek Hadash or outside it.
@ref akn:hc_1/p6 akn:hc_1/p7
GIVEN e IS A `teaching employee`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `the circular applies to` e IF
        e's `rated in the teaching employees' grading`
    AND e's `employed by an owner of a ministry-supervised institution`
    AND NOT e's `stage` EQUALS `upper division`

-- ¶20-¶26: the amount for a full position from 1.1.2018 on.
@ref akn:hc_1/p8 akn:hc_1/p9 akn:hc_1/p10 akn:hc_1/p11 akn:hc_1/p12 akn:hc_1/p13 akn:hc_1/p14
GIVEN p IS AN `Ofek Hadash placement`
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `the linked amount for` p IS
    CONSIDER p
    WHEN `academic grade 1`   THEN 340.85
    WHEN `academic grade 1.5` THEN 320.42
    WHEN `academic grade 2`   THEN 299.99
    WHEN `academic grade 2.5` THEN 247.01
    WHEN `any other placement, in Ofek Hadash or outside it` THEN 194.03

@export default The 2016 shekel supplement (CPI-linked) for a full position from 1 January 2018, for a teaching employee in kindergarten, primary, middle division or a teachers' college, under the owners' circular 5778/6
@ref akn:hc_1/p8 akn:hc_1/p9
GIVEN e IS A `teaching employee` @desc the employee
      `the day` IS A DATE @desc the day the supplement is paid for
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `the linked shekel supplement for a full position` e `the day` IS
    IF `the circular applies to` e AND `the day` AT LEAST Date 1 1 2018
    THEN `the linked amount for` (e's `placement`)
    ELSE 0

-- akn:hc_1/p15 akn:hc_1/p16 A pointer to circular 5777/3 for the supplement's other rules; no rule of its own.

-- ¶29: the owners are indemnified at the relevant hour costs in the
-- payments system; no date is named.
@ref akn:hc_1/p17
GIVEN `indemnity due` IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A DEONTIC Party `linkage action`
DECIDE `indemnifying the owners` `indemnity due` IS
    PARTY `the Ministry of Education`
    MUST  `indemnify the owner at the hour costs` `amount`
          PROVIDED `amount` AT LEAST `indemnity due`

-- akn:conclusions The sign-off and the copies list; no rule.

§§ `Worked examples`

`a grade-2 primary teacher` MEANS `teaching employee` WITH
    `rated in the teaching employees' grading` IS TRUE
    `employed by an owner of a ministry-supervised institution` IS TRUE
    `stage` IS `primary school`
    `placement` IS `academic grade 2`

`an upper-division teacher` MEANS `teaching employee` WITH
    `rated in the teaching employees' grading` IS TRUE
    `employed by an owner of a ministry-supervised institution` IS TRUE
    `stage` IS `upper division`
    `placement` IS `any other placement, in Ofek Hadash or outside it`

#ASSERT `the linked shekel supplement for a full position` `a grade-2 primary teacher` (Date 1 2 2018) EQUALS 299.99
#ASSERT `the linked shekel supplement for a full position` `a grade-2 primary teacher` (Date 1 12 2017) EQUALS 0
#ASSERT `the linked shekel supplement for a full position` `an upper-division teacher` (Date 1 2 2018) EQUALS 0

-- The lower the grade number, the larger the supplement.
`the amounts fall as the grade number rises` MEANS
        `the linked amount for` `academic grade 1` GREATER THAN `the linked amount for` `academic grade 1.5`
    AND `the linked amount for` `academic grade 1.5` GREATER THAN `the linked amount for` `academic grade 2`
    AND `the linked amount for` `academic grade 2` GREATER THAN `the linked amount for` `academic grade 2.5`
    AND `the linked amount for` `academic grade 2.5` GREATER THAN `the linked amount for` `any other placement, in Ofek Hadash or outside it`
#ASSERT `the amounts fall as the grade number rises`

#TRACE `indemnifying the owners` 500 AT 0 WITH
    PARTY `the Ministry of Education` DOES `indemnify the owner at the hour costs` 500 AT 1

§§ `Property checks`

-- The circular over a finite space: graded and supervised or not; every
-- stage and placement; days on either side of 1.1.2018.

`both booleans` MEANS LIST TRUE, FALSE
`every stage` MEANS LIST `kindergarten`, `primary school`, `middle division`, `teachers' college`, `upper division`
`every placement` MEANS
    LIST `academic grade 1`, `academic grade 1.5`, `academic grade 2`, `academic grade 2.5`,
         `any other placement, in Ofek Hadash or outside it`
`the days checked` MEANS LIST Date 1 12 2017, Date 31 12 2017, Date 1 1 2018, Date 2 1 2018, Date 1 6 2018, Date 1 1 2019

GIVEN g IS A BOOLEAN
      o IS A BOOLEAN
      s IS A `stage of education`
      p IS AN `Ofek Hadash placement`
GIVETH A `teaching employee`
DECIDE `a checked employee` g o s p IS
    `teaching employee` WITH
        `rated in the teaching employees' grading` IS g
        `employed by an owner of a ministry-supervised institution` IS o
        `stage` IS s
        `placement` IS p

-- ¶18-¶26 over the whole space: the supplement is the placement's linked
-- amount exactly for a graded, supervised employee outside the upper
-- division from 1.1.2018, and nothing otherwise; whenever it is paid it is
-- between the lowest and the highest amount printed.
#ASSERT all (GIVEN g YIELD
                all (GIVEN o YIELD
                        all (GIVEN s YIELD
                                all (GIVEN p YIELD
                                        all (GIVEN d YIELD
                                                LET x MEANS `the linked shekel supplement for a full position` (`a checked employee` g o s p) d
                                                IN      x EQUALS (IF g AND o AND (NOT (s EQUALS `upper division`)) AND d AT LEAST Date 1 1 2018
                                                                  THEN `the linked amount for` p ELSE 0)
                                                    AND ((x EQUALS 0) OR (x AT LEAST 194.03 AND x AT MOST 340.85)))
                                            `the days checked`)
                                    `every placement`)
                            `every stage`)
                    `both booleans`)
            `both booleans`

-- The upper division is never paid under this circular, whatever the
-- placement or the day.
#ASSERT all (GIVEN p YIELD
                all (GIVEN d YIELD
                        `the linked shekel supplement for a full position` (`a checked employee` TRUE TRUE `upper division` p) d EQUALS 0)
                    `the days checked`)
            `every placement`
